    {
      "body": "Still applies on current main: `python/sglang/srt/models/qwen4_exp.py:1593` imports `qwen4_decode` unconditionally, so Qwen4Exp construction still fails on XPU installs without `tvm_ffi`. The branch merges cleanly (259 commits behind, no conflicts in the one touched file).\n\nThe red checks are only `pr-gate` (missing the `run-ci` label). @BBuf (author of #42175) or @arathi-hlab, could one of you take a look and add `run-ci` if it looks right? Thanks.\n",
